--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project analyses a dataset it does not own and does not redistribute:

  datasocial/tiktok-5.6B-videos  —  https://huggingface.co/datasets/datasocial/tiktok-5.6B-videos

That dataset is licensed CC BY-NC 4.0 (Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International), which
prohibits commercial use. Nothing here grants rights to it.

The repository does contain one derived file, `data/fixtures/demo_sample.parquet` — 20,000 rows
sampled from the source, included only so a fresh clone can be demonstrated without downloading the
full corpus. It remains subject to CC BY-NC 4.0: non-commercial use only, attribution required. No
other dataset rows are committed, and no full partition is redistributed here.

Third-party Python dependencies remain under their own licences.

