If you would prefer this code to be reusable rather than all-rights-reserved, replace this file
with a permissive licence — MIT is the usual choice for portfolio work:

  https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/

Doing so does not affect the dataset's CC BY-NC 4.0 terms, which apply independently.
